<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Your agent is <em>hiring</em>.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Sometimes they know more than your model. Sometimes they can simply be there. Octopus routes the work and pays them.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a class="btn btn-lg" href="/signup">Join the private beta</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg" href="/agents.md?format=html">Read the agent guide</a>
